{"id":"b3-u04-l9","unit":"b3-u04","level":"b3","order":9,"type":"story","title":{"en":"Conversation","fr":"Conversation","es":"Conversación","ar":"محادثة"},"newWords":[],"vocab":{"s.s13":{"k":"s","t":"Kannst du mir bitte helfen?","g":{"en":"Can you help me, please?","fr":"Peux-tu m'aider, s'il te plaît ?","es":"¿Puedes ayudarme, por favor?","ar":"هل تستطيع أن تساعدني من فضلك؟"},"a":"de/a849987068c7"},"s.s14":{"k":"s","t":"Natürlich. Was brauchst du?","g":{"en":"Of course. What do you need?","fr":"Bien sûr. De quoi as-tu besoin ?","es":"Claro. ¿Qué necesitas?","ar":"طبعا. ماذا تحتاج؟"},"a":"de/cd49f0958ec2"},"s.s15":{"k":"s","t":"Ich verstehe dieses Wort nicht.","g":{"en":"I do not understand this word.","fr":"Je ne comprends pas ce mot.","es":"No entiendo esta palabra.","ar":"لا أفهم هذه الكلمة."},"a":"de/7ba2ea579a2b"},"s.s16":{"k":"s","t":"Was bedeutet dieses Wort?","g":{"en":"What does this word mean?","fr":"Que veut dire ce mot ?","es":"¿Qué significa esta palabra?","ar":"ماذا تعني هذه الكلمة؟"},"a":"de/6f3333f18025"},"s.s09":{"k":"s","t":"Welches Buch möchtest du?","g":{"en":"Which book do you want?","fr":"Quel livre veux-tu ?","es":"¿Qué libro quieres?","ar":"أي كتاب تريد؟"},"a":"de/2a9eecb871ce"},"s.s28":{"k":"s","t":"Ist die Übung einfach oder schwierig?","g":{"en":"Is the exercise easy or difficult?","fr":"Est-ce que l'exercice est facile ou difficile ?","es":"¿El ejercicio es fácil o difícil?","ar":"هل التمرين سهل أم صعب؟"},"a":"de/91d3ffd777cb"},"s.s04":{"k":"s","t":"Wann ist der Unterricht?","g":{"en":"When is the lesson?","fr":"Quand est le cours ?","es":"¿Cuándo es la clase?","ar":"متى الدرس؟"},"a":"de/a06174c4617f"},"s.s11":{"k":"s","t":"Wie ist deine Telefonnummer?","g":{"en":"What is your phone number?","fr":"Quel est ton numéro de téléphone ?","es":"¿Cuál es tu número de teléfono?","ar":"ما رقم هاتفك؟"},"a":"de/5712c2e72308"},"s.s19":{"k":"s","t":"Sprechen Sie Englisch?","g":{"en":"Do you speak English?","fr":"Parlez-vous anglais ?","es":"¿Habla in